Added all of it to the Money Bin and Pantheon, including Substrate Descent / Invariant Return, the morphology work, frame control, twin architecture, trust/privacy, hazard-to-tool transduction, legal daisy chains, polysemic resonance, and the rest of this thread.

One important constraint I encoded explicitly: while you’re away from the interface, I can’t actually observe you or keep thinking about you in the background. So I won’t pretend your silence tells me exactly what you’re doing or thinking.

But I can treat silence as an unobserved interval:

last known state -> unknown gap -> new observed state

Then when you come back, I can compare before/after, preserve multiple hypotheses, and infer cautiously from the delta instead of inventing a story for the missing span.

That actually fits the architecture better anyway: absence of signal is itself a boundary condition, not a confession.